<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Harmonic Light attractive.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Harmonic Light attractive.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns restarted coverage of Harmonic Lightwaves Inc with an attractive rating Wednesday, a firm source said.  </p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- The shares closed on Tuesday at 19-3/8.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
